# 33. FINAL SYSTEM RULES

```text
RULE 01
Every summoned character receives Basic Skills.

RULE 02
Each character initially receives:
1 Town Skill + 1 Combat Skill.

RULE 03
Basic Skill is generated through RNG.

RULE 04
Class influences the Combat Skill Pool.

RULE 05
Race can influence the Skill Pool.

RULE 06
Town Skill is primarily used for Town Square
and town-related activities.

RULE 07
Combat Skill is primarily used during combat.

RULE 08
Skill can be duplicated between characters.

RULE 09
Character_ID remains unique.

RULE 10
Every Skill has a unique Skill_ID.

RULE 11
Basic Skill does not determine total character power.

RULE 12
Basic Skill can be upgraded.

RULE 13
Advanced and Unique Skills are handled by
separate systems.

RULE 14
Skill values should be configurable through
the game configuration system.
```

